    'docComment' => '/**
 * TenantContext — the kernel\'s ambient tenancy state (doc 02 §4).
 *
 * Holds the resolved tenant id, active membership and org for the current
 * request/job. Fail-closed: any code reading the context outside a resolved
 * scope MUST receive null and deny, never default to "all tenants".
